---
title: ManualRefund State Machine
---
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> PendingRefund : obligation created (valid cancellation / approved claim)
    PendingRefund --> AwaitingVerification : Operator submits transfer evidence
    AwaitingVerification --> Refunded : Admin verifies evidence (submitter != verifier)
    AwaitingVerification --> PendingRefund : Admin rejects evidence (reason noted, Operator re-submits)
    Refunded --> [*]
